<title>FINLAND: Finnish Nov GDP rises 4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish Nov GDP rises 4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's gross domestic product (GDP) rose 4 percent year-on-year in November, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Adjusted for seasonal factors, GDP rose 0.3 percent in November on October, SF said.</p>
<p>			  Nov 1996     Oct 1996	 Nov 1995</p>
<p> Yr/yr		  +4   pct	 +5.7 pct	+3.1 pct</p>
<p> Mth/mth		+0.3 pct	 +0.4 pct	+0.0 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
